{"data": [{"broadcast_id": "BkqIsCeRkE", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-22", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760536, "segment_id": "VSyKm1Vx3L", "segment_broadcast_id": "BkqIsCeRkE", "segment_title": "Preview/Introduction Tom Brokaw (New York)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 40, "segment_type_id": 1, "segment_start_time": "63000.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760536, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Preview", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "BkqIsCeRkE", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-22", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760536, "segment_id": "I0HLVbf3Tt", "segment_broadcast_id": "BkqIsCeRkE", "segment_title": "September 11 / Commission Report / Kean, Hamilton Interviews", "segment_description": "(Studio: Tom Brokaw) The final report of the commission investigating the September 11 attacks summarized. \n (Washington: Lisa Myers) The 9/11 Commission\u2019s report reviewed; details given of the major findings: that Presidents Bush & Clinton could have done more against terrorism, the intelligence failures by the CIA & FBI, and details about the final moment of United Flight 93; cockpit conversation of Flight 93 hijacker Ziad Jarrah&#134; & others quoted. [9/11 Commission chair Thomas KEAN&#134;- says an attack of even greater magnitude is possible & probable; comments on Bush & Clinton not taking it seriously enough.] [9/11 Commission vice chair Lee HAMILTON&#134;- says we just didn\u2019t get it.] [Commission member Bob KERREY&#134;- comments on facts being withheld.] \n (Studio: Tom Brokaw) The Commission\u2019s recommendations for a new national intelligence chief, a new counterterrorism center & a new domestic security congressional committee noted. Taped discussion held with Kean & Hamilton about their findings. [KEAN \u2013 explains the importance of sharing information among intelligence agencies; comments on the new rules of a stateless enemy.] [HAMILTON \u2013 says the intent & capability to kill Americans is still there; comments on the loss of some civil liberties in exchange for security.] \n (White House: David Gregory) The political impact of the Commission\u2019s report examined. [At the White House, BUSH \u2013 says if the government needs to act, we will.] [Later, campaigning in Illinois, BUSH \u2013 says the recommendations are consistent with the strategy the administration is following.] [In Detroit, Senator John KERRY \u2013 criticizes the administration for not making the country safer.] [Senator Patty MURRAY&#134;- says we\u2019ll see if the Republican leadership is listening.] [Representative Dennis HASTERT&#134;- says we implemented a lot of these things before the report came out.] [Pollster Andrew KOHUT&#134;- notes the report\u2019s impact on Bush\u2019s campaign.] The unlikelihood that Congress will act on the recommendations this year noted.", "segment_duration": 500, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63040.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760537, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "BkqIsCeRkE", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-22", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760536, "segment_id": "56kuJNOhQF", "segment_broadcast_id": "BkqIsCeRkE", "segment_title": "Decision 2004 / Bush vs. Kerry", "segment_description": "(Studio: Tom Brokaw) Findings of an \u201cNBC News\u201d/\"Wall Street Journal\" poll on the direction of the country and the presidential race cited.", "segment_duration": 50, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63540.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760538, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "BkqIsCeRkE", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-22", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760536, "segment_id": "fPrk6aWh2i", "segment_broadcast_id": "BkqIsCeRkE", "segment_title": "Turkey / Train Derailment", "segment_description": "(Studio: Tom Brokaw) The derailment of a new high-speed train in Turkey reported; scenes shown from Pamukova.", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63590.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760539, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "BkqIsCeRkE", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-22", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760536, "segment_id": "qZukGLB4hG", "segment_broadcast_id": "BkqIsCeRkE", "segment_title": "Iraq, Afghanistan / Prisoner Abuse Scandal", "segment_description": "(Studio: Tom Brokaw) Report introduced. \n (Pentagon: Jim Miklaszewski) The Army\u2019s investigation into prisoner abuse by US soldiers in Iraq & Afghanistan featured; details given about the finding of a lack of discipline & leadership at Abu Ghraib. [Before Congress, Army Secretary Les BROWNLEE&#134;&#134;- says we were unable to identify systemwide failures that resulted in incidents of abuse.] [Senator John McCAIN, Army Inspector General Paul MIKOLASHEK&#134;&#134;\u2013 exchange views on coalition commander Lt. Gen. Ricardo Sanchez\u2019 approval of the use of unmuzzled dogs in interrogation.] [Senator Jack REED&#134;- comments on the concealment of prisoners from the International Red Cross.]", "segment_duration": 130, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63620.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760540, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "BkqIsCeRkE", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-22", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760536, "segment_id": "DpLkg9XGjO", "segment_broadcast_id": "BkqIsCeRkE", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Tom Brokaw)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63750.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760541, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "BkqIsCeRkE", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-22", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760536, "segment_id": "d4